1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,700
Running a shop isn't easy. Accounts in a register, sums on a calculator, and counting stock late at night.

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:19,700
Who took how much on credit? Which item is about to run out? How much did you earn today? Often there is no answer.

3
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:29,700
Dukania: billing, stock and credit accounts for your shop, all in one app.

4
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:39,700
It works on your phone and on your computer. Grocery, mobile shop, hardware or clothes.

5
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:51,700
Getting started is easy. Enter your shop name, type and phone number. That's it.

6
00:00:52,400 --> 00:01:01,700
Add your products: name, rate, unit. Keep one rate for the Box and another for a single piece.

7
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:09,700
Already have a list in Excel? Import it in one go.

8
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:21,700
A new bill: type the product name and press Enter. The bill builds in seconds.

9
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:33,700
Loose goods are easy too. Sell by the kilo, or when a customer asks for fifty rupees of sugar, type the amount and the quantity appears.

10
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:49,700
A tray at one price, a single egg at another. Sell either way. The rate is right automatically, and stock goes down correctly.

11
00:01:50,400 --> 00:02:04,700
At checkout choose cash, UPI, card or credit. And you see your profit, which the customer never sees.

12
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:16,700
Make a bill PDF and send it straight to WhatsApp from your phone. Every bill carries your shop name and number.

13
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:29,700
Print on A4, or a small thermal receipt. Whatever suits your counter.

14
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:44,700
Credit accounts live in the app, not in a register. Every customer's balance at a glance.

15
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:59,700
When a payment comes, tap Receive Payment. Old bills clear automatically and the balance goes down.

16
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:11,700
The app tells you which items are running low before they run out. Don't wait for the stock to finish.

17
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:29,700
Stock arrived from the supplier? Add a purchase. Stock goes up by itself, and what you owe the supplier shows too.

18
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:41,700
On the dashboard: today's earnings, profit and stock, at a glance.

19
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:54,700
Sales, profit and GST reports, as a PDF whenever you need them.

20
00:03:55,400 --> 00:04:04,700
The same shop, the same accounts, on your phone too. A computer at the counter, a phone in your pocket.

21
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:14,700
Even if the internet goes, billing keeps working. As soon as the net is back, everything syncs.

22
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:24,700
Try it free for 7 days. Then decide.

23
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:34,700
Visit softraxa.in now, or message us on WhatsApp. Dukania: shop accounts, made simple.

